    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 5 is a well presented refurbished, first-floor, two-bedroom apartment superbly positioned just off North Circular Road, close to the junction with Dorset Street in the heart of Dublin 7.\n\nRecently refurbished throughout, the property is presented in walk-in condition and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation. It is ideally suited to first-time buyers, those seeking a convenient city-centre base, or investors looking for a well-located property close to Dublin city centre.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious living room/dining area finished with wood flooring and access to a Juliet balcony.\n\nThe modern kitchen features contemporary white gloss cabinetry with generous counter top and storage space. Integrated appliances include an electric hob and oven, while there is also plumbing for a washing machine/dryer and space for an under-counter fridge/freezer.\n\nThere are two generous double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes and wood flooring.\n\nThe bathroom suite is finished with classic white subway tiling to the splash areas and attractive decorative floor tiles. The wash-hand basin incorporates a practical vanity storage unit.\n\nApartment 5 enjoys an excellent Dublin 7 location, surrounded by a wide variety of cafés, shops, restaurants and everyday amenities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport and offers convenient access to Dublin city centre, making this an attractive opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\n"
